<scopecontent>
<p>Personal Papers contain agreements, clippings, correspondence, genealogy, invitations, speeches, telegrams, and other documents detailing Andrew P. Miller's personal life and professional career.  Includes correspondence from his parents Francis P. Miller (1895-1978) and Helen Hill Miller (1899-1995) and his brother Robert D. Miller (1934-2016).  Papers also cover his his legal and political career, as well as his involvement with civic and educational organizations.
</p>
</scopecontent>
